==Battleground==
*1 [[Lord Gravey]] spawns as the boss after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ghost Doge]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ghost Snache]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ghost Baa Baa]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*10 [[Zroco]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zroco]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 10~30 seconds<sup>300f~900f</sup>.
*3 [[Zomboe]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The strategy here is to just do what you did for the [[Moon (Empire of Cats)|Moon/Iriomote]] stage's [[Zombie Outbreaks|Zombie Outbreak]] in [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 1. Keep track of Lord Gravey's knockbacks to know when he's at half health. It is highly recommended to bring [[:Category:Zombie Killer Cats|Zombie Killer Cats]] to defeat the numerous amounts of [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombies]] here (e.g., [[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Sifu Cat]], [[Welterweight Cat (Rare Cat)|Heavyweight Cat]]). Defeating Lord Gravey opens up the way to destroy the enemy base. Once he is defeated, victory will be yours.

